  "prefLabel": "Plc 1307.06 Scope of Practice for Licensed Radiographers",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1307.06 Scope of Practice for Licensed Radiographers. The scope of practice for radiographers certified by the ARRT shall be the ASRT’s “Radiography Practice Standards”, effective June 26, 2022, available at https://www.asrt.org/main/standards-regulations/practice-standards/practice-standards and as noted in Appendix B.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Plc 1300) #13701, eff 8-1-23",
